{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:11 2026-09-16 HKT</p>\n\n<p>33歲的前TVB小花蘇韻姿近日在社交平台大派福利，正在布吉旅行的她，上載多張火辣泳裝照，相中的她換上剪裁性感誘人的泳衣，不僅纖腰零贅肉兼現緊緻線條，S形曲線極致誘惑，最吸睛的莫過於她轉身大晒飽滿渾圓的蜜桃臀，健康膚色襯托一雙修長美腿，展現健康性感美態，惹來大批網民洗版瘋狂點讚，激讚她離巢後狀態大勇。</p>\n<h2>蘇韻姿北上參加戀愛真人騷</h2>\n<p>離巢後的蘇韻姿積極開拓新市場，早前她參與了內地近年新興的微綜藝戀愛真人騷《Flip戀愛局》。她在節目中展現最真實的感情世界，不單與高大帥氣的內地男模特兒配對成功，兩人在節目中甜蜜互動更令觀眾看得面紅耳赤，話題度極高。而除了內地戀綜，早前她在長壽音樂劇《我們的青春日誌》及青春外傳劇場《Nancy勞軍Show》中，將傲嬌「收兵娘娘」Nancy一角演繹得活靈活現。</p>\n<img alt=\"33歲的蘇韻姿憑處境劇《愛回家之開心速遞》成功入屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/23d3e292c82187d57d4bab0470b82660/2025-01/SO_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿在《愛回家》飾演熊心如。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c00918e69530515bcf15e76610205961/2025-01/SO_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿近日在社交平台，分享一襲椰林印花性感泳衣，盡顯魔鬼腰臀比例。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41ef216bb7e6ebeb2ee074f7412ae263/2026-09/SaveClip_App_808999994_18627721255046711_5931154989183213912_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿大晒神級「蜜桃臀」，展示完美S形曲線。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/beb451d0dd4489789f68759bf901463c/2026-09/SaveClip_App_795981785_18627721237046711_2401740737640421230_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿踩入沙灘漫步，逆天美臀與一雙修長美腿極度吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9e739c1940cfcf0f2cc882e50cde2588/2026-09/SaveClip_App_796052639_18627721264046711_2700452828032241893_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿在夕陽下，大晒修長美腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c47055252c3798b11e09d600b2552bb9/2026-09/SaveClip_App_800295721_18627721246046711_248651222713933808_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"迎著夕陽逆光燦笑，蘇韻姿展現健康美態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3f659f52562c9ac3b6f81a7340655dc/2026-09/SaveClip_App_802504947_18627721279046711_4931966819819948846_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿戴上文青頭巾，在布吉島地標鐘樓前大展招牌甜笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94a86524cef75db4689e865845f068ae/2026-09/SaveClip_App_812223953_18627443023046711_7718502939477782130_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿（左）換上網狀透視沙灘裙，與閨密齊齊大晒玉背。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/420ed575873a755991509739bf2e5a9f/2026-09/SaveClip_App_812645732_18627721282046711_7063689463290905271_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿從加拿大回流香港。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d09a1c7b9b58d6a053449d25d7b18ffb/2022-10/unknown_240793402_931413034121307_6171036124220771605_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿傳因工作態度差而被踢出《愛回家》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/768fd7db125c2b42931b644b90338720/2023-05/unknown_336797377_901220651148618_8900506949655465744_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿2024年離巢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e319930565b610ab3555f6134e900600/2023-04/fung_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿演出舞台劇《Nancy勞軍Show》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e44b71811683ca351069a7818a3e80ca/2025-01/469447632_1128703711923912_5004087846534244526_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿挑戰獨腳戲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45a5577e9496909fc350f7de1ac8194a/2025-01/SO_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿參與製作部份及擔任服裝統籌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c2233904331a97ab33dd9403ff796f64/2025-01/SO_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿早前為音樂劇《Nancy勞軍Show》綵排。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb2515056e74f5ac6f1d091f1ce2efbf/2025-01/SO_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿綵排期間曾經失聲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/88be3da4540157cc433b32812637276c/2025-01/SO_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿不慎病倒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c0bf429c6f994816071e9f722c412cc/2025-01/SO_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿早前接受網上節目訪問，大談跟前度的情史。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ec0beff3c86465739189dd01ee57363/2025-08/21.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿指現在對男人沒有期望。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/76ef1d44e76d409fb5b667f04931cac1/2025-08/22_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿指跟前度因「性」不合而分開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1c57b5235508bb3ca8a18875d36316d/2025-08/24_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原來蘇韻姿指的是「性格」，鬼妹仔中文不好惹來誤會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e0627b9249963078804d4fabcae46734/2025-08/25_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿表示希望前度過得好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f08667d4d11fa00b522304d499eb5262/2025-08/26_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿聽傷心情歌，立即淚流滿面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fb567d0f2497af8286716c97903b6ff/2025-08/27_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿指聽歌時湧出好多回憶，並指跟前度未能走下去是十分可惜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed5cefab02799106497b0acb25d1cb34/2025-08/28_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"TVB節目《大整蠱》，曾見到周嘉洛極度緊張蘇韻姿，劉丹更指二人要派帖。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fcadf7d7490be71c66ca45a8cfd240f/2025-08/GG.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿雪藏期間努力出IG PO。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3056d6fbc1b46510149d85ff62c9a651/2023-03/unknown_330006654_5854613464594164_7212630450857458446_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿開設YouTube頻道。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bc27b93f27ed8965b2d9319e86d6b75/2023-03/Road%20to%20%E5%8F%B0%E6%85%B6%20_%20VLOG%28%E7%B2%B5_ENG%20sub%29%20_%20Andrea%20So%20%E8%98%87%E9%9F%BB%E5%A7%BF%200-25%20screenshot.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿對被指遲到，自爆慘食死貓。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0385d40a33b4619a4554a5da61bc3593/2024-06/VS--YouTube-King2030Phonein95903809200624-41_43_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿出席《非份之罪》開鏡時，自認不足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c812e9ea8a4ccb079d27c80ca7c5fca/2024-04/andreaso_01a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿與視后楊茜堯（右）合拍劇集《黑色月光》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d7248af01fd83ebe10229fb628af500/2024-04/andreaso_05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿在社交網為音樂班招生，反應不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2178711cc4cf23da15df1769c5fa22e8/2024-05/007_5.jpg\"/>\n<h2>蘇韻姿離巢後獲HOY TV招攬</h2>\n<p>蘇韻姿憑TVB處境劇《愛回家之開心速遞》演出「熊心如」一角，形象入屋。2024年離巢後，迅速獲HOY TV招攬，與阮偉倫主持的飲食旅遊節目《日式流行》，更參演該台首部原創電視劇《我愛九龍城》。身具音樂專長的她亦發揮所長，曾加盟謝東閔與吳業坤合辦的音樂學院擔任星級導師，親自以全英語開班教授兒童音樂劇歌唱技巧，走出舒適圈作出各種嘗試。</p>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿2024年宣布離巢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f088d713ce3dab939195f2cddc77d727/2024-04/andreaso_00000.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿離巢前貼出一輯索爆街拍。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/402d423e674319a6d20f070ed215605d/2024-04/andreaso_14.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿已回復窈窕身形。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa76ca6f449b0f1a3894a09bd1df4de2/2023-06/andreaso__352392681_1335163254073980_8984872082357116158_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿參加《2016香港小姐競選》入行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/04535c94b024ccf1dfa685218a1100e6/2022-09/286701822_5030819180349123_7734336876388462806_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿2017年加入《愛回家》。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51219e7d1e42e5fecc7f680d20015d58/2022-09/299558626_5205204919577214_5165594520850229991_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿（右）在《愛回家》飾演「熊心如」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c25935e468b6624ef3d187ac2363dc2/2024-04/andreaso_00a.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿曾在《愛回家》性感演出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b9e72f37f7c0ee7dc8de1e1f37cf7fa/2024-04/andreaso_00b.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿憑「熊心如」一角彈起。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fc6a3483c10b71a55c4356dfa98beb3c/2022-09/299643980_5205204916243881_4745582070256250269_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿融入《愛回家》大家庭。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/682985f8446c0d579c78a37490b469c3/2022-09/289356207_5067815973316110_7224949947798628495_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熊心如同風少關係升溫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd725c96dd4678842cdcdbe7d3d95136/2023-01/unknown_323672843_998096008244420_7304416266986360355_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"朱天梯突然間又出現，更帶熊心如離開熊家。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecccb00e90880467a9d5c50cd978ee65/2023-01/unknown_323683077_681727770112845_8924969442236502957_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劇情指熊心如同朱天梯去歐洲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d614035336bc0e8b50ef110e37303121/2023-01/VideoScreenshot---myTVSUPER-19%E2%80%9927%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有指「出走」是與蘇韻姿的工作態度有關。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eda872ea30c1ea90ca41f83d7460bb1a/2023-01/VideoScreenshot---myTVSUPER-20%E2%80%9902%E2%80%9D.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿離巢後想在音樂劇、舞台劇方面發展。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/39c810cfe5836bae85ed8b5465e3c29e/2024-04/andreaso__1713762715_3351607039469784110_234158710.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿生日獲「熊家人」慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/59562084c1cd6f139c3f8bf38b9607d9/2024-04/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_04_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"劉丹親吻蘇韻姿，被網民大讚他真的當女兒般愛錫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/48b01f1c0ff66b944b4a0bb7ad9f9d69/2024-04/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_05_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"單立文老婆胡蓓蔚為蘇韻姿戴王冠。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c06c7f1afd3e85d44366984183f2877b/2024-04/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_06_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿更搞笑地做出港姐招牌揮手。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8adc038be7271ad3589f57b5b503fe88/2024-04/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_08_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"滕麗名、張景淳、胡蓓蔚、古佩玲和陳浚霆都有出席。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2434be5a0d28e24eb81dfa292e0994d1/2024-04/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星女蘇韻姿感動落淚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a364f950bb4257da98a03962db8209d1/2024-04/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"壽星女蘇韻姿感動落淚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5a828911f22b6b67e03869f4df0cc298/2024-04/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿生日網民細數缺席的成員，只有周嘉洛、袁文傑及劇中寵物「啤啤」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe61139f6f2730ebe0deded83dd26c03/2025-01/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘇韻姿收到兩個生日蛋糕，其中一個是禮物盒中夾住熊仔，相當有意思。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0958a38f61f77d32c8d58a33548bc13b/2024-04/VS--andreasoInstagram-0_21_.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-16T08:19:35.585260+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":553,"images":55,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}